sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as PR Author
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant OR as Orchestrator
    participant AG as Agent Services (×5)
    participant VDB as ChromaDB
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Dev->>GH: open or push to a pull request
    GH->>GW: POST /webhooks/github (pull_request)

    GW->>GW: verify X-Hub-Signature-256 (HMAC-SHA256)
    alt signature invalid
        GW-->>GH: 401 invalid_signature
        Note over GW: payload is never parsed or forwarded (FR-GW-03)
    else signature valid
        GW->>DB: look up repository + enabled agents + threshold
        DB-->>GW: config (agents, threshold, timeout)
        GW->>OR: POST /internal/v1/review-jobs (Idempotency-Key = delivery id)
        OR-->>GW: 202 { jobId, reviewId }
        GW-->>GH: 202 accepted
        GW->>GH: create Check Run in progress (within 5s, AC-01)
    end

    Note over OR,AG: fan-out — all enabled agents called in parallel (FR-ORC-01)

    par Security
        OR->>AG: POST /v1/review (diff hunks only, NFR-06)
        AG-->>OR: findings[] + confidence
    and Style
        OR->>AG: POST /v1/review
        AG-->>OR: deterministic fixes, no LLM call (NFR-07)
    and Performance
        OR->>AG: POST /v1/review
        AG-->>OR: findings[]
    and Logic
        OR->>AG: POST /v1/review
        AG-->>OR: findings[]
    and Documentation
        OR->>AG: POST /v1/review
        AG--xOR: timeout after 20s (NFR-02)
    end

    Note over OR: the timed-out agent is marked no result,<br/>the review still completes (FR-ORC-02, NFR-04, AC-12)

    OR->>OR: de-duplicate on (file, line range, issue type) — FR-ORC-03
    OR->>OR: rank by severity, then confidence — FR-ORC-04
    OR->>VDB: query similar past issues
    VDB-->>OR: similar findings + resolutions (FR-ORC-05)
    OR->>DB: persist review, agent_runs, findings, suggestions
    GW->>OR: GET /internal/v1/review-jobs/{jobId} every 2 s
    OR-->>GW: job with the combined report (status = partial)

    GW->>GH: update Check Run with pass / fail / neutral (FR-GH-02)
    GW->>GH: post inline suggested changes for findings ≥ threshold (FR-GH-03)
    GH-->>Dev: review report and suggestions on the PR

    Note over Dev,GH: nothing is committed to the branch<br/>until the author acts — see UC-3 (FR-GH-04)
